# Project Structure & Architecture Rules

> Iconive variant: **no i18n / `[locale]`**. Sliders use **Swiper**. Icons use **Lucide** (`lucide-react`). UI primitives are **shadcn/ui** only. Styling is **Tailwind CSS v4** (`@import "tailwindcss"` in `src/app/globals.css`).

## Stack

| Concern | Tool |
|---|---|
| Framework | Next.js (App Router, Turbopack) |
| Language | TypeScript 5 (strict mode) |
| Data fetching & server state | TanStack Query v5 (React Query) + Axios |
| Shared client state | Zustand v5 |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |
| UI primitives | shadcn/ui (Radix UI + Tailwind) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS + `cn()` |
| HTTP client | Axios instance (`src/lib/axios.ts`) |
| Validation | Zod |

