## 7. Component Rules

- **Pages (`app/[route]/page.tsx`)** — thin shell. Import the feature component, nothing else.
- **Feature components** — call the feature hook, pass data down to smaller components.
- **UI components (`components/ui/`)** — receive only props, no hooks, no store access.
- **No business logic in JSX** — extract to the hook or a util function.

```tsx
// ✅ src/app/products/page.tsx — thin shell
import { ProductsView } from './components/ProductsView'
export default function ProductsPage() {
  return <ProductsView />
}

// ✅ src/app/products/components/ProductsView.tsx — owns the hook
'use client'
import { useProducts } from '@/hooks/useProducts'

export function ProductsView() {
  const { products, isLoading, handleSearch, handlePageChange } = useProducts()
  return (/* render only */)
}
```

