## 9. Naming Conventions

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Components | PascalCase | `ProductCard.tsx` |
| Feature hooks | camelCase `use[Feature]` | `useProducts.ts` |
| Store files | camelCase + `.store.ts` | `cart.store.ts` |
| Service files | camelCase + `.service.ts` | `products.service.ts` |
| Type files | camelCase + `.type.ts` | `products.type.ts` |
| Query key file | `queryKeys.ts` | `src/utils/queryKeys.ts` |
| Route folders | kebab-case | `app/product-detail/` |

---

## 10. Design Consistency

- All tokens from Tailwind theme / CSS variables. No hardcoded hex or arbitrary spacing unless necessary.
- Primitives defined once in `src/components/ui/`. Never redefine base styles inline.
- Always use `cn()` for conditional class merging.

```ts
// ✅ src/utils/cn.ts
import { clsx, type ClassValue } from 'clsx'
import { twMerge } from 'tailwind-merge'
export function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {
  return twMerge(clsx(inputs))
}
```

---

## 11. Barrel Exports

```ts
// ✅ src/components/global/navbar/index.tsx
export { NavDesktop } from './NavDesktop'
export { NavMobile } from './NavMobile'
```

Import from the folder, never the deep file path:

```ts
// ✅
import { NavDesktop } from '@/components/global/navbar'
// ❌
import { NavDesktop } from '@/components/global/navbar/NavDesktop'
```

---

## 12. Quick Checklist

Before finishing any feature, verify:
- [ ] API call goes through `src/services/[feature].service.ts` via Axios instance
- [ ] Data fetching is inside a feature hook using `useQuery` / `useMutation`
- [ ] Query keys use the centralised factory in `src/utils/queryKeys.ts`
- [ ] Mutations follow `onMutate → onError → onSettled` optimistic pattern when needed
- [ ] Zustand stores hold only shared client state (not API data)
- [ ] Store selectors are atomic; multiple values use `useShallow`
- [ ] `devtools` on every store; `immer` for nested state; `persist` for refresh-surviving state
- [ ] Page file is a thin shell — no logic, no hooks
- [ ] Feature hook owns all business logic, filtering, pagination, search
- [ ] Types defined in `src/types/[feature].type.ts` with no `any`
- [ ] UI primitives in `src/components/ui/`, never redefined inline
- [ ] `cn()` used for all conditional Tailwind classes
```

